# remove-pages, the same probes on the fixed build

## The strip reaches a page picker again (screenshots 5, 8, 9)
DOM after loading colour.pdf: thumbs 4, strip found, no disclosure needed
tile 3 clicked -> field "1-2,4", strip counts "3 OF 4 SELECTED" once -> run kept source sheet 3 only (checker below)

## The range sentence, once (screenshot 7)
PAGES=9 -> problems array ["\"9\" refers to page 9, but this document has 4 pages."] (was two identical lines), plus "Still needed:"

## The identity, carried (screenshot 6)
/tmp/rp/meta.pdf {'title': 'meta fixture title', 'author': 'meta author', 'subject': 'meta subject', 'keywords': 'alpha, beta', 'creator': 'meta-creator', 'producer': 'meta-producer'} xmp 381
/tmp/rp/after-meta.pdf {'title': 'meta fixture title', 'author': 'meta author', 'subject': 'meta subject', 'keywords': 'alpha beta', 'creator': 'meta-creator', 'producer': 'BrowserSnip'} xmp 381
