## Controls
wrong kept list 1,2,3 on the drop2 file -> 4 failures (line, box, rotate, ink)
the source as its own output, all kept -> OK; and claiming a drop it did not make -> 4 failures
a second run of the same input (after-drop2b.pdf): same 3 sheets, same boxes, same ink, same title, 1974 vs 1973 bytes — the difference is the creation date alone
the untitled fixture invents no /Info and no /Metadata (edge-organize.test.ts control)

## Refusals, unchanged and true
all -> DISABLED + "Choose the pages to delete - deleting every page would leave an empty PDF."
1-4 typed -> the run sentence "Deleting pages 1-4 would remove all 4 pages, leaving an empty PDF." + hint
one of one -> the same; out of range -> the range sentence, once
